Portal Loginer desktop protocol core

Protocol behavior is derived from Small-SaltedFish/Portal_Loginer, version 1.4.1,
commit dcaffa81af551e3f259ddb1433a170aff8b840b6.
Source: https://github.com/Small-SaltedFish/Portal_Loginer
Original license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The desktop implementation replaces shell, curl, UCI and OpenWrt-specific
mechanisms with Rust protocol, transport and scheduling modules. Deliberate
behavior changes and outstanding compatibility limits are recorded in
docs/MIGRATION.md and docs/CORE.md.

fixtures/tls-test-key.pem is a generated, public test-only key for a local
untrusted-certificate test. It is never a release signing or production key.

